 },
 {
  "text": "Rodrigo, thank you for the tour. Can you explain how a flavor is made here?",
  "voice": "ellen",
  "file": "a27_rodrigo_thank_you_for_the_tour_can_you_explain_h.mp3"
 },
 {
  "text": "Of course. First, the formula is created by our team in the lab.",
  "voice": "arthur",
  "file": "a27_of_course_first_the_formula_is_created_by_our_te.mp3"
 },
 {
  "text": "And the ingredients? Where do they come from?",
  "voice": "ellen",
  "file": "a27_and_the_ingredients_where_do_they_come_from.mp3"
 },
 {
  "text": "Most of them are imported. Every ingredient is checked when it arrives.",
  "voice": "arthur",
  "file": "a27_most_of_them_are_imported_every_ingredient_is_ch.mp3"
 },
 {
  "text": "Interesting. What happens next?",
  "voice": "ellen",
  "file": "a27_interesting_what_happens_next.mp3"
 },
 {
  "text": "The ingredients are weighed very carefully, and then they are mixed in these tanks.",
  "voice": "arthur",
  "file": "a27_the_ingredients_are_weighed_very_carefully_and_t.mp3"
 },
 {
  "text": "Is every batch tested?",
  "voice": "ellen",
  "file": "a27_is_every_batch_tested.mp3"
 },
 {
  "text": "Yes. Every batch is tested in the quality lab. If it is OK, it is approved.",
  "voice": "arthur",
  "file": "a27_yes_every_batch_is_tested_in_the_quality_lab_if.mp3"
 },
 {
  "text": "And after that?",
  "voice": "ellen",
  "file": "a27_and_after_that.mp3"
 },
 {
  "text": "The flavor is packed, it is stored in the warehouse, and it is shipped to the customer.",
  "voice": "arthur",
  "file": "a27_the_flavor_is_packed_it_is_stored_in_the_warehou.mp3"
 },
 {
  "text": "Every ingredient is checked when it arrives.",
  "voice": "arthur",
  "file": "a27_every_ingredient_is_checked_when_it_arrives.mp3"
 },
 {
  "text": "How is it made?",
  "voice": "ellen",
  "file": "a27_how_is_it_made.mp3"
 },
 {
  "text": "Hi Rodrigo, it's Claire. Quick news from France. Our new vanilla flavor is ready. The formula is created in Grasse, and the flavor is made in three plants: in France for Europe, in China for Asia, and in Brazil for South America. The samples are ready, and they are sent to you today. Please test them and tell me what you think.",
  "voice": "ellen",
  "file": "a27_listening1.mp3"
 },
 {
  "text": "Welcome to the New York subway. More than three million people use it every day. The trains are cleaned every night, and the stations are checked every morning. Tickets are not sold on the train: you pay at the gate, with your card or your phone. Enjoy your trip!",
  "voice": "arthur",
  "file": "a27_listening2.mp3"
 },
 {
  "text": "First, the formula is created in the lab. Then the ingredients are weighed. They are mixed in big tanks. Every batch is tested in the quality lab. Finally, the flavor is packed and shipped to the customer.",
  "voice": "arthur",
  "file": "pc_order_l27.mp3"
 },
